# AI Whiteboard (browser extension) makes no calls to any AI provider API itself — the AI
# request happens through the chat site the user is already using. There are no secrets for
# this project to hold, so this file intentionally defines no variables.
#
# Kept present (not deleted) because scripts/verify.mjs requires it to exist as a structural
# check. If a future phase adds a real need for local configuration, define it here as names
# and safe defaults only — never commit real credentials.
